    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Pamela Naggessar",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102607598376507018806/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocK-4-FBaw2LZp_Vwof2oKtqDBNVU1isBf-SqJOBUm6-TloHVg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Terrible customer service, please beware and do not support. Last Thursday I took four outfits to get dry  cleaned at Daoust in Vaudreuil (they were an evening gown, a toddler flower girl dress, my husband's suit and my 5 year old's suit). The cleaner said that it would be ready on Monday. The next day I received a call from the manager from Daoust telling me how the buttons on my son's suit had melted off and there is nothing he can do. I would need to buy my own buttons and he would sew them on free of charge was his compensation for ruining the suit. I went today the pick up the clothing and told him that I wasn't paying for the damaged suit but I would pay for the rest. I told them I was mad about the situation and didn't think I should pay for a ruined auit.Him and his co worker got defensive and said that I was accusing them that it was their fault to which I replied well you guys did clean it no? They persisted to tell me that they have been in business for X amount of years and his co worker tells me that this happens all the time (which was contradictory to what the manager had told me a week before when I spoke to him over the phone he said it's rare to have buttons melt like this and that they were cheap buttons and that's why they melted). In the midst of all of the getting defensive and arguing over why it wasn't their fault, the woman that works there tells me it's because you bought this suit from India it's cheap, which I didn't). I left the suit because I refused to pay for it. My husband was with me and he heard every word that was said and he felt scammed and that they had the suit now and could possibly sell it. So later that afternoon my husband told me he was going back to get the suit. He basically told the woman that we were dissatisfied with the work that was done and if there was anything price wise she could do to compensate. This time the woman told us to pay up or get out and she called the police on us. They came and obviously there was nothing they could do about this, another worker came out (super nice) and shook his head and said to us in front of the cops I wanted to give you guys a discount in the first place and he basically didn't charge tax for the suit. Would never go back or recommend this place to anyone.",
        "time": 1717896662,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Andrew Laramee",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115664713202649926445/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWadnzzuoQYh2ksS1dmWRB94mmAmX03GqZV7lF3nHg7nY3qcDv5=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5",
        "rating": 4,
        "relative_time_description": "6 years ago",
        "text": "Got my suit jacket and pants cleaned here, they seem to have done a good job. I brought a tree skirt that needed cleaning but they wouldn't take it so I'm not sure where the line is of what they can or can't clean. The staff were mostly friendly, there was one woman who was a bit rude to me when I dropped everything off. Overall I'm happy with the service.",
        "time": 1552927600,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Fred",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100564119508762778329/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWdMdtH0gk5f11AQhyWmu_oZT8ONVzt3mk8Trc3QL-mjhMsviU0=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 years ago",
        "text": "They do it always right great customer service, Herald & Fils Ile-Perrot charged me to ruined my coat, This wont happen here. Keep up the good work and thank you once again. A1+.",
        "time": 1671828457,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Jeremie A",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113188082972928959153/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIXZWi_4fUQpQHN6M9Lw4QLh4vYGkrqWyzUSPz1FFD6DagIaw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "3 years ago",
        "text": "I used their service 3 times to wach my suits and every time I get the suits exactly like I gave it to them no change.. the ladies whos work in the place are ok , the man who is there is very rude.. don't waste your money",
        "time": 1662684904,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Aaron Edmond",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100317780279084645482/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKyCuk04FaRYMinc5W3EZJCLiR2GTFk9nDhUKK4T0_uxt_LHA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "6 years ago",
        "text": "So they lost or you could say STOLE my wife wedding dress. We sent my wife's wedding dress to be dry cleaned and boxed. This dry cleaner shipped it to another company to do the work called  suedart a part of martin inc. The dry cleaner called us saying it was done and come pick it up. Not a day later they called us back saying that there was a problem with the box and the way it was sealed ,they would have to send it back to get repaired. A month passed and still no word, finally a call back your dress is ready. We made time to come pick it up a week or so later. Opened the box at hope to show my wife and...... panic its not the right dress!!! Who has the dress.. We went back with pictures and showed the dry cleaner it wasn't the right dress in fact it wasnt even the right color. They took it back and assured us this dress would be found. Its been a year now,  we later found out that they sent it to the wrong person and now are unable to retrieve it. Do not do business with this company. Who loses a wedding dress? We still have not been refunded the cost to clean it or compensated for the dress.",
        "time": 1563916198,
        "translated": false
      }
